{"type":"message","id":"c2d46a9f","parentId":"4ad09211","timestamp":"2026-03-17T17:27:57.097Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Whisper安装一直在运行但没有成功。让我尝试一个不同的方法 - 使用ffmpeg提取音频，然后使用在线API或替代方案。实际上，让我先检查下是否可以使用其他工具或方式。\n\n实际上，我发现transcribe.py已经写好了，只是缺少whisper模块。让我尝试一种完全不同的方法 - 使用ffmpeg将m4a转换为wav，然后使用其他的语音识别方式，或者尝试用不同的方式安装whisper。\n\n让我再试一次直接安装whisper，如果还是不行，我就用其他方法完成任务。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:200","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install openai-whisper --user --no-deps 2>&1 | tail -10","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace","timeout":300}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:201","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install torch torchaudio --user --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu 2>&1 | tail -10","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace","timeout":600}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:202","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install tiktoken 2>&1 | tail -5","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace","timeout":60}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:203","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install more-itertools 2>&1 | tail -5","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace","timeout":60}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:204","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install tqdm 2>&1 | tail -5","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace","timeout":60}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:205","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python -c \"import whisper; print('Whisper loaded successfully!')\" 2>&1","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:206","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"import whisper\nimport warnings\nimport os\nimport time\n\nwarnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n\naudio_path = r'C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\video_download\\四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-王秀萍.m4a'\noutput_path = r'C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\video_download\\transcript.txt'\n\nprint('=' * 60)\nprint('Whisper语音转录')\nprint('=' * 60)\n\nif not os.path.exists(audio_path):\n    print(f'错误: 找不到音频文件')\n    exit(1)\n\nfile_size = os.path.getsize(audio_path)\nprint(f'音频: {os.path.basename(audio_path)}')\nprint(f'大小: {file_size/1024/1024:.1f} MB')\nprint()\n\nprint('[1/3] 加载Whisper模型 (large-v2)...')\nstart = time.time()\nmodel = whisper.load_model('large-v2')\nprint(f'完成，耗时: {time.time()-start:.1f}秒')\nprint()\n\nprint('[2/3] 转录中 (约需15-25分钟)...')\nstart = time.time()\nresult = model.transcribe(audio_path, language='zh', verbose=True)\nelapsed = time.time() - start\nprint(f'\\n转录完成！耗时: {elapsed/60:.1f} 分钟')\nprint()\n\nprint('[3/3] 保存文本...')\nwith open(output_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    f.write(result['text'])\n\nprint(f'已保存: {output_path}')\nprint(f'字符数: {len(result[\"text\"]):,}')\nprint()\nprint('=' * 60)\nprint('完成！')\nprint('=' * 60)\n","path":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\video_download\\transcribe.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773768444585}}
