{"type":"message","id":"12a121b9","parentId":"ba49afde","timestamp":"2026-03-17T17:58:20.494Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"B站视频字幕提取任务已完成。我需要先读取现有逐字稿文件，然后将其转换为Word文档格式。让我继续处理Word文档的创建，需要确保python-docx库已安装并能正常运行。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:323","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace\\video_download\\四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-王秀萍-逐字稿.txt","limit":100}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:324","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install python-docx","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:325","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\video_download\\create_docx_simple.py","content":"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-nfrom docx import Documentnn# 创建 Word 文档ndoc = Document()nn# 添加标题ntitle = doc.add_heading('四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-王秀萍（逐字稿）', level=0)nn# 添加空行ndoc.add_paragraph()nn# 读取内容并添加nwith open('四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-王秀萍-逐字稿.txt', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:n    for line in f:n        line = line.strip()n        if line and not line.startswith('='):  # 跳过空行和分隔线n            doc.add_paragraph(line)nn# 保存文档ndoc.save('四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-王秀萍-逐字稿.docx')nprint('Word文档已保存成功！')"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:326","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd video_download && python create_docx_simple.py","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:327","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd video_download && dir *.docx","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:328","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd video_download && ls -lh","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:329","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\video_download && dir /b *.docx 2>nul || echo \"未找到docx文件\"","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:330","name":"exec","